   1132  f228							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1133  f228							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1134  f228							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1135  f228							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1136  f228							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1137  f228							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1138  f228				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1139  f228							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
