   1491  f3e7							; ± ENEMY_WIDTH = overshoot), side chosen by ROM dir (initial facing). Ignores editor range_* per user
   1492  f3e7							; 2026-09-23. First move = facing (live dir from LoadEnemyRam). No wall collision.
