   2729  f9c4							;		     walls hide the parked M1 in unpatched bands (PF > M1 in
   2730  f9c4							;		     the priority chain — convert enforces the solid cell).
   2731  f9c4							; Runs before the single HMOVE (HMP0+X shadow registers accumulate).
   2732  f9c4							; Sym path cost: jsr+rts overhead only — no RESP/HMP write, frames stay
