   3595  fedb							; BeamMask — per-scanline ENAM0 values for the in-window kernel path (S2.2).
   3596  fedb							; Indexed by Y = A0 = Scanline - RoomY, rows 0-11 only.
   3597  fedb							; Rows 2-3 = $02 (beam on: RoomY+2..RoomY+3 = eye rows — yellow face row 2 +
   3598  fedb							; red row 3 = two-tone beam; kept per user decision: single-red rows could
   3599  fedb							; not also reach floor-standing enemies without kill-window churn); rest $00.
   3600  fedb							; 2026-10-08 user directive: ONE strip, yellow — row 2 only ($02 at index 2),
   3601  fedb							; row 3 dropped. Kill window in LaserHitTestBody stays rows RoomY+2..3 = a
   3602  fedb							; superset of the 1-line draw (floor-standing reach preserved).
   3603  fedb							; Lives in the $FExx page: `lda BeamMask,Y` from .Line ($F1xx) fetches in
   3604  fedb							; 4c when operand+11 stays in-page (1c reclaim toward the ObjColorTab
   3605  fedb							; write; verify_build asserts the no-cross operand range).
   3606  fedb							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
