   3754  ff56							; step would jump out of the 8px wall with no candidate ever inside it
   3755  ff56							; (pass-through, 2026-10-10). dec clears b0; bne .LaserInit: state ≠ 0
   3756  ff56							; here (b7 held from the ora above). Open-hold cadence alternates
